{{#step}}
Create the R2 bucket that holds the media and the page cache, declining Wrangler's offer to add the binding itself as in step 1:

   {{> cloudflare/r2-bucket}}
{{/step}}
{{#step}}
Create the bucket of the backups. Only the cron Worker binds it, so the Worker that serves the public media cannot read them:

   ```bash
   {{#inDirectory "apps" (deployAppDir)}}{{installedBinaryRunner}} wrangler r2 bucket create {{projectName}}-backups --no-update-config{{/inDirectory}}
   ```
{{/step}}
